Package: credentials
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: systemd (>= 250), debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Description: local credentials vault for development
 Small local HTTP server (JSON API + admin interface) storing encrypted
 credentials (AES-256-GCM, key derived with Argon2id) in a SQLite database.
 The systemd service starts at boot; its passphrase is encrypted with
 systemd-creds (TPM2 + host key).
